### Realizar Transferência (Primeira execução)
POST http://localhost:8080/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sourceWallet": 1,
  "destinationWallet": 2,
  "amount": 10.00,
  "idempotencyKey": "key-transfer-001"
}

###

### Testar Idempotência (Reenvio com a mesma chave)
POST http://localhost:8080/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sourceWallet": 1,
  "destinationWallet": 2,
  "amount": 10.00,
  "idempotencyKey": "key-transfer-001"
}